        <item>
                    <title>Version 1.4.9</title>
                    <link>https://icons.ahmetdedeler.com</link>
                    <sparkle:version>3014900000</sparkle:version>
                    <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
                    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:42:07 +0000</pubDate>
                    <enclosure url="https://icons.ahmetdedeler.com/download/Iconic-1.4.9.dmg"
                    sparkle:edSignature="y3a9PgR5iwSFYR9OyA3Jj0NT4WpT9GPNrkfffeBW0yY9zPQDuzWnDhHwB8izEFRyFay765zRk/3fZ6+S/jHaDg==" length="7618312"
                    type="application/octet-stream"/>
                    <description>
                        <![CDATA[
                    <h2>Version 1.4.9</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Light/Dark icon switching now refreshes the Dock reliably. Previously the right icon was written but the Dock could keep showing the old one until you ran `iconic refresh-dock`.</li>
                        <li>Fixed random icons flipping to the wrong Light/Dark variant (or briefly turning into a folder) when the CLI refreshed the Dock while Iconic was open.</li>
                        <li>Opening Iconic after an appearance change no longer pulls other apps' windows to the front.</li>
                        <li>Your license now renews itself in the background. Before, Macs that ran Iconic hidden at login or used only the CLI could stop applying icons after 30 days.</li>
                    </ul>
                        ]]>
                    </description>
                </item>
        <item>
                    <title>Version 1.4.8</title>
                    <link>https://icons.ahmetdedeler.com</link>
                    <sparkle:version>3014800000</sparkle:version>
                    <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
                    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 07:46:38 +0000</pubDate>
                    <enclosure url="https://icons.ahmetdedeler.com/download/Iconic-1.4.8.dmg"
                    sparkle:edSignature="uNKe1ubdwoHbbI0MOQUPo3H/AUZ8h430AH7VNIVHF3dxRj8AFMPsgQ6fa9OGHAo5TsW0oY+5/P/9KxzPsrh3CQ==" length="7694017"
                    type="application/octet-stream"/>
                    <description>
                        <![CDATA[
                    <h2>Version 1.4.8</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Arc, Warp, and other apps that draw their own Dock icon are now detected. Iconic explains why the Dock won't change and points you to the app's built-in icon picker instead of reporting a success you can't see.</li>
                        <li>CLI: catalog matching now prefers exact and whole-word app names, so "Arc" gets an Arc icon instead of "Archive Folder", and a style miss never silently applies a different app's icon.</li>
                        <li>CLI: app names resolve to exact matches first; <code>iconic apps --json</code> flags apps whose Dock icon is app-controlled.</li>
                    </ul>
                        ]]>
                    </description>
                </item>
        <item>
                    <title>Version 1.4.7</title>
                    <link>https://icons.ahmetdedeler.com</link>
                    <sparkle:version>3014700000</sparkle:version>
                    <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
                    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 01:53:30 +0000</pubDate>
                    <enclosure url="https://icons.ahmetdedeler.com/download/Iconic-1.4.7.dmg"
                    sparkle:edSignature="2Z+clM/dZim7W2kI5OwhZRAMKAh7HHBRN955mFsXoLVtmvhboug8MWcVC/3XdsUgIrqEFxIcPyQXFvxOMvIeDw==" length="7667860"
                    type="application/octet-stream"/>
                    <description>
                        <![CDATA[
                    <h2>Version 1.4.7</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Improves Apple system app icon handling and makes failed unpinned Dock applies clearer.</li>
                        <li>Refreshes Dock and Finder icon presentation more reliably after restores and cached icon reapplies.</li>
                        <li>Hardens shared app/CLI icon cache syncing so command-line removals are not resurrected by the running app.</li>
                        <li>Improves license activation, collection staging, and hosted catalog API edge cases.</li>
                    </ul>
                        ]]>
                    </description>
                </item>
